    "reviews": [
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_40nVyMBBDQRPNHLZn4FjIw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdE1WRkpPRVppVTBFeVRrVlRVVEZtWWtGemNsRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "5 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "不是米芝蓮級數的餐廳, 但廚師全晚所創造的, 就是烹飪的靈魂.\n\n我享受了一個極美麗的晚上, 令到魚肉有了最美麗的靈魂！\n\n如果你邀請的人能夠和你分享到這一份快樂, 如果你也喜歡這一餐, 那你邀請的一位一定是你心靈的最好夥伴.\n\nCe n'est pas un restaurant étoilé au Michelin, mais ce que le chef crée tout au long de la soirée, c'est l'âme de la cuisine.\n\nJ'ai passé une soirée absolument magnifique, qui a donné aux poissons une âme des plus belles !\n\nSi la personne que vous invitez peut partager cette joie avec vous, et si vous appréciez également ce repas, alors la personne invitée que vous avez en nvité(e) sera assurément votre meilleur compagnon.\n\n💚🥀💚🥀💚🥀",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "不是米芝蓮級數的餐廳, 但廚師全晚所創造的, 就是烹飪的靈魂.\n\n我享受了一個極美麗的晚上, 令到魚肉有了最美麗的靈魂！\n\n如果你邀請的人能夠和你分享到這一份快樂, 如果你也喜歡這一餐, 那你邀請的一位一定是你心靈的最好夥伴.\n\nCe n'est pas un restaurant étoilé au Michelin, mais ce que le chef crée tout au long de la soirée, c'est l'âme de la cuisine.\n\nJ'ai passé une soirée absolument magnifique, qui a donné aux poissons une âme des plus belles !\n\nSi la personne que vous invitez peut partager cette joie avec vous, et si vous appréciez également ce repas, alors la personne invitée que vous avez en nvité(e) sera assurément votre meilleur compagnon.\n\n💚🥀💚🥀💚🥀",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Sea See",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/104317832547327571444/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUJ3OyMfOwTRxoRMKWbkEPVhc4sXa4eoJcRWn64zds26nAHOeE=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba5"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-04-29T01:07:27.878396804Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdE1WRkpPRVppVTBFeVRrVlRVVEZtWWtGemNsRRAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xOdE1WRkpPRVppVTBFeVRrVlRVVEZtWWtGemNsRRAB!2m1!1s0x3404012357278dff:0x8c8c057e66cbd13c"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_40nVyMBBDQRPNHLZn4FjIw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OTWRYaElkV0pEUVhsRlZVZHFWbU5SYURGS2JuYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": {
          "text": "去那裡慶祝生日，結果非常失望。我們點了品嚐菜單。開胃菜是一盤冰涼的蔬菜丁，跟隔壁Jean-Pierre餐廳的菜一模一樣。也許有人會喜歡，但我感覺味道寡淡，像兔子飼料一樣。\n\n主菜更是令人失望：所有菜餚都油膩膩的，調味料完全掩蓋了海鮮本身的味道，菜單上明明標榜使用新鮮的當地海鮮，卻讓人大失所望。扇貝和蟹腿尤其難吃。紅蝦意麵還可以，但油膩得過頭了。\n\n飯後，我的胃感覺就像連續吃了三塊Vision餅乾一樣難受。",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Went there for a birthday celebration and was so disappointed. We tried the tasting menu. It started with a cold plate of chopped vegetables on ice, which was the same thing served in Jean-Pierre next door, maybe some people would like it but I found it bland and looked like rabbits food.\nThe main dishes were a big let-down: everything was really buttery and the seasoning covered the taste of the seafood, which is a pity as the menu boasted using fresh, local sea produces. The scallop and crab leg were particularly horrible. The red prawn pasta was okay but again really buttery.\n\nAfter the meal my stomach felt as if I had had three Vission cookies in a row.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Cathy Chan",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114650280533392576154/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocL-HgIPPjXMvMujyz7XdG0W8ucNAUgztq4DJ5RmSksnfiI6xg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-08-07T09:11:48.681642888Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OTWRYaElkV0pEUVhsRlZVZHFWbU5SYURGS2JuYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21OTWRYaElkV0pEUVhsRlZVZHFWbU5SYURGS2JuYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404012357278dff:0x8c8c057e66cbd13c"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_40nVyMBBDQRPNHLZn4FjIw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOMmNscDJNMVJIYVhkUldGSkJNR3hoWTAxQ1NtYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "6 個月前",
        "rating": 4,
        "text": {
          "text": "We had the tasting menu.\n\nThe cold plates were excellent. Generally I do not like sardine but their sardine toast was very good. The crudo was also excellent. Vegetables were very fresh.\n\n1 star deducted for the hot plates. They are not bad at all. But at that price we were expecting just a bit more. Particularly on the crab legs, it’s fine, not something that would wow you. Same thing goes to the scallop. Pasta was good but again not something that’d impress you deeply.\n\nWine pairing was excellent.\n\nBut don’t get me wrong overall it’s a nice place, good vibes, very nice staff, food is great just a bit pricey.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "We had the tasting menu.\n\nThe cold plates were excellent. Generally I do not like sardine but their sardine toast was very good. The crudo was also excellent. Vegetables were very fresh.\n\n1 star deducted for the hot plates. They are not bad at all. But at that price we were expecting just a bit more. Particularly on the crab legs, it’s fine, not something that would wow you. Same thing goes to the scallop. Pasta was good but again not something that’d impress you deeply.\n\nWine pairing was excellent.\n\nBut don’t get me wrong overall it’s a nice place, good vibes, very nice staff, food is great just a bit pricey.",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
