        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pOMmNscDJNMVJIYVhkUldGSkJNR3hoWTAxQ1NtYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404012357278dff:0x8c8c057e66cbd13c"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_40nVyMBBDQRPNHLZn4FjIw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxRlNDMDJSVE5FVXpKaGIyRlBZMVZOU0dONk4zYxAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "3 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "從頭到尾都令人驚艷！食物、飲料、優美的環境以及所有員工都營造出獨一無二的體驗——絕對是香港海鮮愛好者的天堂。所有菜餚都美味至極，餐廳的整體氛圍也與菜餚完美契合！這絕對是我在香港最愛的新去處之一！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "Incredible from start to finish! The food, the drinks, the beautiful space and all the staff make it a really unique experience - perfect for seafood lovers in HK. All the food was incredible and the overall vibe of the place matches it through and through! One of my new fave spots in HK!",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
        "authorAttribution": {
          "displayName": "Charlie Hayward",
          "uri": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114419270000552106117/reviews",
          "photoUri": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKz_OKI5tQvIIyyPjkZ_lrN2maZSIRD3VH33vakdlaeb60C1Q=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo"
        },
        "publishTime": "2026-07-13T13:51:02.278987747Z",
        "flagContentUri": "https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId=Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxRlNDMDJSVE5FVXpKaGIyRlBZMVZOU0dONk4zYxAB&d=17924085&t=1&wv=1",
        "googleMapsUri": "https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data=!4m6!14m5!1m4!2m3!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2kxRlNDMDJSVE5FVXpKaGIyRlBZMVZOU0dONk4zYxAB!2m1!1s0x3404012357278dff:0x8c8c057e66cbd13c"
      },
      {
        "name": "places/ChIJ_40nVyMBBDQRPNHLZn4FjIw/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25OU2IzZHlUVVZJVGtzNVdYZElVREpXUmxKaFZrRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "2 個月前",
        "rating": 5,
        "text": {
          "text": "食物真的非常美味，品質也非常好。份量稍微有點少，但味道都很棒。紅蝦意麵是我的最愛－絕對一流！特別感謝Apurv和Gabriel，他們非常友好，讓晚餐更加愉快。我和朋友們在那裡度過了一個美好的夜晚！",
          "languageCode": "zh-TW"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "The food was really delicious and the quality was excellent. The portions were a little small for the price, but everything tasted great. The red prawn pasta was my favourite dish - second to none!Special thanks to Apurv and Gabriel, who were super friendly and made the dinner even more enjoyable.I had a great night with my friends there !",
          "languageCode": "en"
        },
